			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 3 components\n\nSynchronize Cocoon, Mountain, and Wind submodules with the following changes:\n- **Wind:** Regenerate compiled MountainImplementation.js to reflect Channel registry migration — replaces `mountain_get_status` string literal with `Channel.MountainGetStatus` reference, updating all IPC channel invokes to use typed Channel imports for compile-time validation.\n- **Cocoon:** Submodule updated to c4626acecda9fba76e991b542c5240721e2e88c1.\n- **Mountain:** Submodule updated to 85483ef53b574cfa1ad8bd98fa1d5eb622c8e87e.\n\nThis ensures the built JavaScript artifacts stay synchronized with the TypeScript source refactoring that added compile-time validated IPC channel names.",
